# Send only what "npm ci" and the application need to the build context: the
# package files, the JavaScript files, and the page that the application serves.
# Anything else (.git, node_modules, manifests, docs) would bloat the images
# and invalidate the build cache on every unrelated change.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!**/*.js
!static
**/node_modules/**
